<title>USA: Yonkers Financial sets 10 pct shr buyback.</title>
<headline>Yonkers Financial sets 10 pct shr buyback.</headline>
<dateline>YONKERS, N.Y. 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yonkers Financial Corp said on Monday it received approval from the Office of Thrift Supervision on its previously reported plan to repurchase 10 percent of its outstanding stock.</p>
<p>Yonkers Financial is the holding company for The Yonkers Savings and Loan Association.</p>
<p>Purchases would be made over a six-month period starting on or after October 18, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Shares would be bought on the open market, it said.</p>
<p>As of June 30, Yonkers Financial said it had 3,570,750 shares outstanding.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
